# Logseq keyboard shortcuts (defaults; mod = cmd on macOS, ctrl elsewhere)
# `g s` opens the live, authoritative list. Rebind in config.edn :shortcuts.

## Navigation (chords, only when the editor is NOT focused)
g h   home                 g j   journals            g a   all pages
g g   graph view           g w   whiteboards         g s   shortcuts
g t   tomorrow             g n   next journal        g p   prev journal
g f   flashcards           g shift+g  all graphs
mod+[ / mod+]              back / forward
mod+k                      search
mod+shift+k                search in page
mod+shift+p                command palette

## Toggles
t r   right sidebar        t l   left sidebar        t t   theme
t d   document mode        t w   wide mode           t s   settings
t o   open/close all blocks               t n   numbered list
t c   flashcards           t p   plugins             t i   theme colour
shift+/                    keyboard help
c t                        close top sidebar item
mod+shift+j                open today in the sidebar (alt+shift+j on Linux/Win)

## Editing
enter / shift+enter        new block / new line inside the block
tab / shift+tab            indent / outdent
mod+enter                  cycle TODO marker
mod+z / mod+shift+z        undo / redo
mod+b  mod+i               bold / italics
mod+shift+h                highlight
mod+shift+s                strikethrough
mod+l                      insert link
mod+o                      follow link under cursor
mod+shift+o                open link in right sidebar
mod+e                      copy block embed
mod+shift+v                paste as plain text into one block
mod+shift+r                replace block ref with its text
mod+shift+y                insert youtube timestamp

## Moving and selecting
mod+shift+up / down        move block up / down    (alt+shift on Linux/Win)
alt+up / alt+down          select block above / below
shift+up / shift+down      extend text selection
mod+a                      select parent block
mod+shift+a                select all blocks
mod+up / mod+down          collapse / expand children
mod+;                      toggle children
mod+. / mod+,              zoom into / out of block  (alt+arrows elsewhere)
mod+shift+f                toggle favourite

## Flashcards review
s  show answers    n  next card    r  remembered    f  forgotten    t  recall

## Rebinding
;; config.edn (or the global config.edn for all graphs)
:shortcuts
{:editor/new-line "shift+enter"
 :editor/up       ["ctrl+k" "up"]
 :editor/down     ["ctrl+j" "down"]
 :ui/toggle-theme "mod+c mod+t"
 :editor/highlight false}         ; false disables a binding
# `+` = pressed together, a space = a chord. `mod` maps to cmd/ctrl.
# Defaults: src/main/frontend/modules/shortcut/config.cljs in logseq/logseq
